meta {
  name: HospitalApi - Auth - Signup (Patient)
}

env {
  baseUrl = "http://localhost:3000"
}

### Sign Up Patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Patient",
  "email": "test.patient@example.com",
  "password": "password1",
  "confirmPassword": "password1",
  "dob": "1990-01-01",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phone": "0812345678"
}

# Notes:
# - Ensure `gender` matches `Gender` enum (MALE/FEMALE).
# - Update `{{baseUrl}}` if your server runs on a different port.
